{"title":"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Team Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a0542dcf550502872617f769d4ff5ee6ceec95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3^{5} - 3^{4}}{3^{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11603ab6c79a6a801063f7e1bb759c2250a7608a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b} \\times a^{c} = a^{b + c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/241cf4cc5c45a5e125f678e37f5b80adddefb8a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3^{3} \\times 3^{5 - 3} - 3^{3} \\times 3^{4 - 3}}{3^{3}} = 3^{5 - 3} - 3^{4 - 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"286\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/a/52a920a9a91c153c229bc42b948bc728cf9092c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=3^{2} - 3^{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/1/d419a1618171af5180cad26fe68c2ff481a47834.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=9 - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/6272e08e606483ea2c2a23d2905640f4885d6d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Team_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/2/8b23237a1cdbb10848642f11a61f61901561763f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3^{5} - 3^{4}}{3^{3}} = \\frac{243 - 81}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/1019ebabb33cf02c217aa3e908db83d630df6875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{162}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/6272e08e606483ea2c2a23d2905640f4885d6d11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC\">2020 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo